hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16161","He said: Abu Said, the freedman of Banu Hashim, narrated to us, he said: Zaidah narrated to us, he said: Shabib ibn Gharqadah narrated to us, from Sulayman ibn Amr ibn al-Ahwas, he said: My father narrated to me that he witnessed the Farewell Hajj with the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: No offender offends except against himself. No father offends against his child, nor a child against his father."
